    "type": "question",
    "label": "22",
    "prompt": "Of 15 courier companies:\n9 offer a local service ($L$), 7 offer an interstate service ($S$) and 6 offer an international service ($I$).\n2 companies offer all three services, 3 offer both local and interstate services, 5 offer only local services and 1 offers only an international service.",
